# --- Raw inputs that must not be redistributed ----------------------------
# 28.7 MB Lands Department terrain model. `src/dtm.py` downloads it if missing
# and says where from; `data/derived/dtm_corridor.asc` is the cropped version
# and IS committed, so a clone can rebuild the network without the download.
data/raw/Whole_HK_DTM_5m.zip

